### macOS permission prompts. The system shows these below its own question, such as "Screenwide would like to access the camera". `pnpm i18n:generate` copies them into the app bundle.

macos-camera-usage = Screenwide uses your camera when you include it in a recording.
macos-microphone-usage = Screenwide uses your microphone when you record audio.
macos-audio-capture-usage = Screenwide records system and app audio when you include it in a recording.
